{"3797740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mystic", "steam_appid": 3797740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/e3c8ba0c33e804b9a9bcc5b5725a8178.poster.avif?t=1761582111\" width=850 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/e3c8ba0c33e804b9a9bcc5b5725a8178.webm?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/e3c8ba0c33e804b9a9bcc5b5725a8178.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the End of Times grew near, &quot;The Signs&quot; began to come true. Powerful forces, the likes of which humans had not seen before&quot; began to arrive on earth, causing destruction. What were once great palaces, and wonders of technology, became ruins. Where humans once roamed the earth, and Jinn were relegated to darkness, the tables were turned, and humans were now savages, relegated to mountains, with Jinn taking over the Palaces. Humans, living like savages, forgot their place on earth, and forgot about the Malakuth realm, and divine knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mere mortal, thrust into the midst of an uninvited battle, what path will you take? The path of <strong>spirituality</strong>: Where your goal is to reclaim the lost knowledge of the Divine - a path of spiritual perfection? Or  the path of <strong>technology</strong>, where you must rediscover lost earthly knowledge to regain technological superiority?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimately, in the epic war of Man vs Jinn, you must purge the Jinn from earth, and reclaim Earth as rightfully yours.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/1d193d8e99a6f1de0d6e8ca3a5bc4a8a.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct shelters using salvaged materials and sacred architecture. Protect yourself from sandstorms, hostile creatures, and encroaching spiritual decay. Customize your camp, and leave marks on the world that others can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/778851e991abdbd87032d17189d585f1.poster.avif?t=1761582111\" width=850 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/778851e991abdbd87032d17189d585f1.webm?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/778851e991abdbd87032d17189d585f1.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/91b713e1c744a5f960e2e347e2fd2786.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft tools, and manage thirst, hunger, fatigue, and spiritual presence. In this world, progress depends on spiritual connection, rituals, offerings, and deciphering ancient symbols unlock pathways that brute force cannot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/fb75256fe5c2f43d71df66f7b85ed145.poster.avif?t=1761582111\" width=850 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/fb75256fe5c2f43d71df66f7b85ed145.webm?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/fb75256fe5c2f43d71df66f7b85ed145.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/c1f40eb7ce6676a4b40ca16715fe8419.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight supernatural threats like jinn, ghouls, desert raiders, and cursed beasts using crafted weapons and spiritual powers. Master timing, precision, and rituals to overcome the darkness that haunts the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/46581421c7a9d5a8ecee984e3dbf1c17.poster.avif?t=1761582111\" width=850 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/46581421c7a9d5a8ecee984e3dbf1c17.webm?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/46581421c7a9d5a8ecee984e3dbf1c17.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/c02a61327ee2c9adca690047273466fd.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ancient evils or slip through the shadows, survival is in your hands. Confront deadly foes with weapons and arcane powers, or evade them with stealth and cunning. Explore deserts and ruined cities, manage hunger and fatigue, and uncover the secrets hidden in the sands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/3715b5537388ad5c2dbf29f24b9c7da9.poster.avif?t=1761582111\" width=850 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/3715b5537388ad5c2dbf29f24b9c7da9.webm?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/3715b5537388ad5c2dbf29f24b9c7da9.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/fcfaca00fb5126adfe7d90233d2fbf6f.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through vast deserts, forgotten temples, and subterranean tombs as you uncover a land haunted by stories long believed to be legend. Dynamic environments, day-night cycles, and spiritual anomalies make every journey unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/6afc2d5feeca9027c39f21c255fdab21.poster.avif?t=1761582111\" width=850 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/6afc2d5feeca9027c39f21c255fdab21.webm?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/6afc2d5feeca9027c39f21c255fdab21.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/5da6521eeb6d01a45cc6c3768cc24f96.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deep into deserts, caves, and ancient ruins to gather rare materials and sacred resources. Unearth hidden caches, precious minerals, and remnants of civilizations long gone. Every excavation brings danger, discovery, and the chance to uncover secrets that could change your survival in a world where the past still holds power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/3c8d2ba804fe3b83e7f0ecbe5285e545.poster.avif?t=1761582111\" width=850 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/3c8d2ba804fe3b83e7f0ecbe5285e545.webm?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/3c8d2ba804fe3b83e7f0ecbe5285e545.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/6ac498d7451424963bdd33b2118e958f.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A myth-rich open world based on authentic Middle Eastern folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiritual progression system with rituals, omens, and ancient knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical survival mechanics with dynamic weather, resource management, and hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional combat: evade, hide, or use mystical protections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric storytelling woven through environment and legend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed crafting, building, and customization options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic soundscape inspired by regional instruments and ancient poetry</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/e3c8ba0c33e804b9a9bcc5b5725a8178.poster.avif?t=1761582111\" width=850 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/e3c8ba0c33e804b9a9bcc5b5725a8178.webm?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/e3c8ba0c33e804b9a9bcc5b5725a8178.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the End of Times grew near, &quot;The Signs&quot; began to come true. Powerful forces, the likes of which humans had not seen before&quot; began to arrive on earth, causing destruction. What were once great palaces, and wonders of technology, became ruins. Where humans once roamed the earth, and Jinn were relegated to darkness, the tables were turned, and humans were now savages, relegated to mountains, with Jinn taking over the Palaces. Humans, living like savages, forgot their place on earth, and forgot about the Malakuth realm, and divine knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mere mortal, thrust into the midst of an uninvited battle, what path will you take? The path of <strong>spirituality</strong>: Where your goal is to reclaim the lost knowledge of the Divine - a path of spiritual perfection? Or  the path of <strong>technology</strong>, where you must rediscover lost earthly knowledge to regain technological superiority?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimately, in the epic war of Man vs Jinn, you must purge the Jinn from earth, and reclaim Earth as rightfully yours.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/1d193d8e99a6f1de0d6e8ca3a5bc4a8a.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct shelters using salvaged materials and sacred architecture. Protect yourself from sandstorms, hostile creatures, and encroaching spiritual decay. Customize your camp, and leave marks on the world that others can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/778851e991abdbd87032d17189d585f1.poster.avif?t=1761582111\" width=850 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/778851e991abdbd87032d17189d585f1.webm?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/778851e991abdbd87032d17189d585f1.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/91b713e1c744a5f960e2e347e2fd2786.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft tools, and manage thirst, hunger, fatigue, and spiritual presence. In this world, progress depends on spiritual connection, rituals, offerings, and deciphering ancient symbols unlock pathways that brute force cannot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c