/6afc2d5feeca9027c39f21c255fdab21.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/5da6521eeb6d01a45cc6c3768cc24f96.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deep into deserts, caves, and ancient ruins to gather rare materials and sacred resources. Unearth hidden caches, precious minerals, and remnants of civilizations long gone. Every excavation brings danger, discovery, and the chance to uncover secrets that could change your survival in a world where the past still holds power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/3c8d2ba804fe3b83e7f0ecbe5285e545.poster.avif?t=1761582111\" width=850 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/3c8d2ba804fe3b83e7f0ecbe5285e545.webm?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/3c8d2ba804fe3b83e7f0ecbe5285e545.mp4?t=1761582111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/extras/6ac498d7451424963bdd33b2118e958f.avif?t=1761582111\" width=851 height=315 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A myth-rich open world based on authentic Middle Eastern folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiritual progression system with rituals, omens, and ancient knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical survival mechanics with dynamic weather, resource management, and hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional combat: evade, hide, or use mystical protections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric storytelling woven through environment and legend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed crafting, building, and customization options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic soundscape inspired by regional instruments and ancient poetry</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Survive in a retro-futuristic world filled with Jinns, animals, and other spiritual entities based on eastern fantasies in the spirit of Arabian Nights and middle-eastern history. Gather, craft, evade and ultimately fight your way to an epic battle between Man vs Jinn.", "supported_languages": "English, Arabic, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/13bff458370108defece1466ddec15c75104b2f3/header.jpg?t=1761582111", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/9d8569d66435055743ba3672f0b660744956cd43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761582111", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797740/9d8569d66435055743ba3672f0b660744956cd43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761582111", "website": "https://ilhaminc.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 2070 (8 GB) / AMD Radeon 5700XT (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any on-board chip will work<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:<